  "prefLabel": "Site 102.43 Rural area",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Site 102.43 “Rural area” means any geographic area in the State of New Hampshire that is not included within an urbanized area or an urban cluster.\n\nSource. #10993, eff 12-16-15",
